	<#f4cf72>ORO</>
	<#aab8c7>Moves & Controls</>

<#72c8eb>BUTTONS</>
Light Punch		^X
Medium Punch		^Y
Heavy Punch		^Z
Light Kick		^A
Medium Kick		^B
Heavy Kick		^C
<#aab8c7>Directions are relative to your opponent.</>
<#aab8c7>A plus sign means simultaneous input.</>

<#72c8eb>MOVEMENT & DEFENSE</>
Forward Dash		_F_F
Back Dash		_B_B
Super Jump		_D_U
Double Jump		_U
<#aab8c7>Release Up, then press Up again during a jump.</>
High Parry		_F
Low Parry		_D
Air Parry		_F
<#aab8c7>Tap the direction just before the attack hits.</>
Personal Action		^Z_+^C
<#aab8c7>Hold both buttons; release either to finish.</>

<#72c8eb>THROWS & UNIQUE ATTACKS</>
Ground Throw		^X_+^A
<#aab8c7>Close range against a grounded opponent.</>
Air Throw		^X_+^A
<#aab8c7>Very close range; both characters airborne.</>
Forward Palm		_F_+^Y
Leap Attack		^Y_+^B
Close Medium Punch > Super Jump		^Y > _D_U
<#aab8c7>Perform the jump after the close punch connects.</>

<#72c8eb>EX MOVES — HOW TO USE</>
<#aab8c7>EX moves are powered-up versions of certain specials.</>
<#aab8c7>Use the normal motion, then press two buttons together.</>
Two Punch buttons		[^X_+^Y/^Y_+^Z/^X_+^Z]
Two Kick buttons		[^A_+^B/^B_+^C/^A_+^C]
<#aab8c7>Use the button type required by that move.</>
<#aab8c7>EX moves spend power; build meter before using them.</>
<#aab8c7>Ground EX moves require 330 power.</>
<#aab8c7>Fireball / Uppercut use Punches; Flying Kick uses Kicks.</>
<#aab8c7>Hold the indicated direction to charge the move.</>

<#72c8eb>SPECIAL MOVES</>
Charge Fireball <#aab8c7>[EX]</>		_B (hold) _F_+[^X/^Y/^Z]
Rising Uppercut <#aab8c7>[EX]</>		_D (hold) _U_+[^X/^Y/^Z]
Command Throw		_F_DF_D_DB_B_+[^X/^Y/^Z]
Flying Kick <#aab8c7>[EX]</>		_D_DF_F_+[^A/^B/^C]
Air Flying Kick <#aab8c7>[EX]</>		_D_DF_F_+[^A/^B/^C]
<#aab8c7>Air Flying Kick: perform during a jump.</>

<#72c8eb>SUPER ARTS</>
I. Grab Mode <#aab8c7>[1000+]</>		_D_DF_D_DF_+[^A/^B/^C]
<#aab8c7>After activation, connect a standing normal</>
<#aab8c7>to enter the grab sequence. Meter drains over time.</>
II. Energy Ball <#aab8c7>[1000]</>		_D_DF_D_DF_+[^X/^Y/^Z]
<#aab8c7>Punch strength changes the ball's trajectory.</>
II. MAX Energy Ball <#aab8c7>[3000]</>		_D_DF_D_DF_+[^X/^Y/^Z]
<#aab8c7>Press two Punch buttons with a full meter.</>

<#72c8eb>VERSION NOTES</>
<#aab8c7>Super inputs use Down, Down-Forward twice.</>
<#aab8c7>The third Super Art is disabled in this version.</>
